Description: End the iostat run loop on SIGINT with a dispatch signal source
 The CoreFoundation library on PIE has no CFFileDescriptor.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-11

--- a/iostat/iostat.c
+++ b/iostat/iostat.c
@@ -21,6 +21,30 @@
  *
